d-0 plus permanent census union: 167 parents, all descendants excluded; 29 census parents subset preserved from original annex"},"extractor":{"U":null,"U_inventory_sha256":null,"formal_acceptance":null,"frozen_eligible_lives":969,"independent_implementation_review":"NO_REMAINING_P1_P2","ordinary_only_siblings":9,"prepared":true,"real_scan_executed":false,"review_packet":"EXTRACTOR_REVIEW_PACKET.md","review_packet_sha256":"8461e16a3e549001f21891ea668587137bb5ce015893c113418c81440003b2c9","row_inventory":null,"row_stratum_counts":null,"selected":960,"synthetic_tests":34},"human_sections":["Prepared the requested source-bound extractor submission and expanded runtime/collision recovery. The requested state of every item closed except U is **not established**: historical runtime identities and complete collision coverage remain HOLD. These gaps cannot be replaced with current-environment facts, inferred aliases or an implementer-written custodian certificate.","","| Item | Evidence and disposition |","|---|---|","| COV extractor | Fixed one-file NPZ contract, 969-life source inventory, eight metadata members only, header-first bounds, forbidden-value access/decode invariance, complete enumeration and redacted refusal tests. Independent implementation review has no remaining P1/P2 findings. Formal acceptance is pending; real scan, both-stratum row counts and U remain unrun/unknown. |","| Historical runtime | Original D256 commit 61900af28932e47e22e332840fc4406559adb062 and D1024 commit 111c47818a097c57451386ef4f8a7009616f8f77; 864/2160 hero+ordered-opponent rosters; linked L4 fit metadata, source/config constructors, RNG/continuation contract and original replay tie rule recovered. Installed builds/CPU and serialized original config/RNG/continuation identities remain HOLD. |","| Collision union | 50 repository audit/allocation sources; 27,340 metadata rows; seven external hash-verified FRP ledgers containing 5,609,050 entries. Combined union: **1,160,637 exact raw seeds**, including 66 negative seeds. Completeness, ancestry/aliases, protected mirrors and custodian attestation remain HOLD. |","| Whole 684-bank audit | Unchanged allocator/auditor: provisional first-clear round **0**, all 684 together (672 science + 12 timing); no rejected prior rounds. Allocation hash 1b9fc89e0a814d68ad075bfc5afb961b5c910cbe37365c0bd678142996ed21d7. Accepted round/hash remain null. No individual replacements or new salt. |","","Extractor review packet: `EXTRACTOR_REVIEW_PACKET.md`, SHA-256 `8461e16a3e549001f21891ea668587137bb5ce015893c113418c81440003b2c9`. Full source, test, contract and frozen-inventory pins appear in that packet and the machine annex.","","Collision union canonical encoding is numeric-order unique raw integers, decimal ASCII plus LF per seed. SHA-256: `3bc1fae311e9d612f306d83f7e96b065940a99f1b3a81ff6c77a8321d25ec926`. Raw signed/uint64 values are preserved; unknown seed normalization and ancestry mappings are not invented. The unchanged audit is run after sound equality/alias pruning; synthetic tests compare its reasons with the unpruned original auditor, including internal and alias-only collisions.","","The two exclusion scopes remain distinct. Training excludes the original 167-parent fold-0/census union and descendants, including all 29 census parents. Fresh banks additionally exclude all historical training/development/validation/probe/strict/serving ancestry, every R30-1 source parent across all splits and any registered R30-2 parents. The original annexs exact lists/hashes remain binding. The catalog is a sealed observed-source inventory; neither filename discovery nor a clear provisional round proves completeness.","","**What remains:** obtain independent source-bound extractor acceptance before a real machine scan, then seal exact row/stratum/U inventories. Recover the missing original runtime facts from lawful contemporary records. Resolve allocation registers, ultimate ancestry/aliases and protected mirrors, and obtain custodian completeness; only then may the whole-bank allocator produce an accepted allocation. Submit the completed annex for independent adoption. None of these unknowns is adopted here.","","Verification: **108 synthetic tests passed** in 1.23s; Black/isort/flake8 and diff checks passed. Tests used nice 15, one math thread and at most two processes, without a worker pool. Independent source reviews are included. No acceptance receipt was created by either implementation reviewer.","","Artifacts: `runtime-evidence-v7/`, `collision-evidence/`, `external-collision-evidence-v2/`, `whole-684-provisional-allocation.json`, `extractor-input-inventory.json`, `extractor-contract.json`, `synthetic-verification.json`. Prior task-created drafts are preserved externally; every original ruling, draft and annex remains unchanged."],"remaining":["independent source-bound extractor acceptance, then separately authorized machine-only scan/sealed full inventory and exact U","historical installed Python/numeric-library/backend builds and CPU identity plus serialized original config/RNG/continuation identity not evidenced in admitted metadata","closed campaign/package allocation-register reconciliation, ultimate ancestry/aliases including any normalization mapping, lawful protected metadata mirrors, and custodian completeness attestation before an accepted allocation","independent adoption after all pre-exposure prerequisites close; F4 post-mortem remains unrun"],"requested_closed_except_U_achieved":false,"runtime":{"current_environment_substitution":false,"evidence":"runtime-evidence-v7/runtime-identities.json","missing_by_origin":{"d1024":["CPU model and instruction-set identity","Python version","NumPy version and BLAS/LAPACK backend/version","PyTorch version/build and CUDA/cuDNN version","numba version","serialized original AppConfig / resolved simulator configuration","serialized Python/NumPy/PyTorch RNG state at continuation boundary","exact continuation snapshot identity and restoration state"],"d256":["CPU model and instruction-set identity","Python version","NumPy version and BLAS/LAPACK backend/version","PyTorch version/build and CUDA/cuDNN version","numba version","serialized original AppConfig / resolved simulator configuration","serialized Python/NumPy/PyTorch RNG state at continuation boundary","exact continuation snapshot identity and restoration state"]},"recovered":["original source/driver/config-construction pins","hero and ordered opponent/checkpoint identities","darwin-arm64 collection platform","L4 CUDA fit target and linked pack/control/manifest identities","RNG initialization and B2 continuation source contract","original four-ULP recorded-action replay rule, scoped to collection validation"],"roster_allocations":{"d1024":2160,"d256":864},"source_commits":{"d1024":"111c47818a097c57451386ef4f8a7009616f8f77","d256":"61900af28932e47e22e332840fc4406559adb062"},"status":"HOLD_RUNTIME_IDENTITIES_INCOMPLETE"},"schema":"bl-f5-gap-closure-summary/v1"}}
